// Initial poses for the sample clouds in this folder, for register_scans --poses.
// Pose of each cloud's own frame in the frame of a.ply:
// [x, y, z, roll, pitch, yaw] (m, rad; R = Rx(roll) * Ry(pitch) * Rz(yaw)).
//
// The clouds are cut from one `bench_slam --save-map` map of living_room_garden
// (163616 points) and moved by a known transform:
//   a.ply  every 2nd point (offset 0), not moved
//   b.ply  every 2nd point (offset 1), true pose [0.10, -0.06, 0.04, 0.01, -0.015, 0.03]
//   c.ply  every 3rd point (offset 1), true pose [1.5, -0.8, 0.2, 0.0, 0.0, 0.5]
//
// b.ply is close enough to a.ply to register from the previous estimate, so it
// is not listed. c.ply is 1.4 m away and needs a starting pose: the one below
// is deliberately a few cm and 0.02 rad off its true pose.
{
    "c.ply": [1.45, -0.77, 0.22, 0.01, 0.0, 0.48]
}
